### Test 1: Send Custom Command - Using UnitId
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/sendCustomCommand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1,
  "command": "AT+GTQSS=gv300,1,0,0,0,0,FFFF$"
}

### Test 2: Send Custom Command - Using PrivateCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/sendCustomCommand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "privateCode": "UNIT-001",
  "command": "AT+GTQSS=gv300,1,0,0,0,0,FFFF$"
}

### Test 3: Send Custom Command - Invalid (no unit identifier)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/sendCustomCommand
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "AT+GTQSS=gv300,1,0,0,0,0,FFFF$"
}

